      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the exhaustion has reached a point where the thought of peace feels like the only possible option. If you are feeling like you want to \"exit the cycle,\" please know that there are people who want to support you through this overwhelming darkness. You can connect with trained, compassionate listeners by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada. Please reach out to them right now.",
      "source": "target",
